{"type":"assistant","message":{"model":"claude-fable-5-1","id":"msg_011CgNwJ0NB6Ur0Qz5Y93HYg","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"The user is asking me to design a portfolio layout system for a 3D artist's two pages, 01_Work and 02_About, grounded in the specified palette, type scale, and grid. I set ink #181717 and accent #2429AF on a page bg #F7F6F3, with surface #FFFFFF, secondary text #6B6862, divider #E3E0D9, and placeholder #EAE7E1. The scale is DM Sans: display 96px Regular at -3% letterspacing, H1 64px, H2 44px, project index 13px uppercase tracking, body 18px/1.7, small 14px, label 12px uppercase at 0.12em. The grid is 1440 wide with 96px margins, 12 cols, 24 gutter, content max 1248.\n\nFor 01_Work the header sits at 96px margin and 96 height: logo \"da.\" at 44px left, nav right with Work/About/Playground/Contact, Work current in accent with an underline. The hero puts \"Hello, I'm Deniz.\" at 96px on the left, supporting text right or below, and a scroll cue bottom right with Icon_Arrow_Down. Projects run as numbered rows 01/02/03, each with name, description, tools, link, and image placeholder on the side, alternating left/right, first project featured large. The footer has a divider, \"Deniz Arslan ⏤ 2020\" left, social links right.\n\nAbout shares the header, then H1 \"Hi, I'm Deniz Arslan, 3D artist & sculptor.\" left with a portrait right (228x320, croppable to ~420x520), then biography in 2 paragraphs, skills in two columns (Main Software, Main Skills), and a contact block reading \"I'd be thrilled to hear about your next project\" with arrow right, email, and View Resume. The footer is shared.","signature":""}],"stop_reason":null,"stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"output_tokens":0,"service_tier":"standard","cache_creation_input_tokens":21088,"input_tokens":1,"cache_read_input_tokens":0,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":0,"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":21088}},"context_management":null},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"cb593a8f-1da1-4bf5-a6dd-8363759ec975","uuid":"3dd46b14-ac71-4ee8-9391-4a3a5852ac04","timestamp":"2026-11-01T23:39:49.652Z","thinking_duration_ms":40782}
{"type":"assistant","message":{"model":"claude-fable-5-1","id":"msg_011CgNwJ0NB6Ur0Qz5Y93HYg","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"text","text":"Brief and assets are clear. I'm building a warm-paper / ink / cobalt system with DM Sans. Starting with the component library on the workspace page."}],"stop_reason":null,"stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"output_tokens":0,"service_tier":"standard","cache_creation_input_tokens":21088,"input_tokens":1,"cache_read_input_tokens":0,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":0,"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":21088}},"context_management":null},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"cb593a8f-1da1-4bf5-a6dd-8363759ec975","uuid":"466ecde5-4100-4f27-ab88-b2103c55deea","timestamp":"2026-11-01T23:39:50.381Z"}
{"type":"assistant","message":{"model":"claude-fable-5-1","id":"msg_011CgNwJ0NB6Ur0Qz5Y93HYg","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"tool_use","id":"toolu_01cmfT8gevvGdxLa6AxvCSIG","name":"mcp__figma__use_figma","input":{"fileKey":"mHbRa1JtNzPaWcjtafC7Br","description":"Create workspace sections and base link components (nav, footer, text links)","skillNames":"figma-use","code":"const page = await figma.getNodeByIdAsync('4:2');\nawait figma.setCurrentPageAsync(page);\nfunction rgb(h){h=h.replace('#','');return {r:parseInt(h.slice(0,2),16)/255,g:parseInt(h.slice(2,4),16)/255,b:parseInt(h.slice(4,6),16)/255};}\nfunction fill(h,o){return [{type:'SOLID',color:rgb(h),opacity:o===undefined?1:o}];}\nconst INK='#181717',ACC='#2429AF',MUTED='#6E6A63',LINE='#DAD5CB',BG='#F5F3EE';\nconst F={R:{family:'DM Sans',style:'Regular'},M:{family:'DM Sans',style:'Medium'},S:{family:'DM Sans',style:'SemiBold'},B:{family:'DM Sans',style:'Bold'},L:{family:'DM Sans',style:'Light'}};\nawait Promise.all(Object.values(F).map(f=>figma.loadFontAsync(f)));\nfunction T(chars,size,font,color,opts){\n  const t=figma.createText(); t.fontName=font; t.characters=chars; t.fontSize=size;\n  t.fills=fill(color||INK); t.lineHeight={unit:'PIXELS',value:(opts&&opts.lh)||Math.round(size*1.35)};\n  t.letterSpacing={unit:'PIXELS',value:(opts&&opts.ls)||0};\n  if(opts&&opts.width){t.textAutoResize='HEIGHT';t.resize(opts.width,t.height);}\n  if(opts&&opts.align){t.textAlignHorizontal=opts.align;}\n  return t;\n}\nfunction frame(name,w,h,color){\n  const f=figma.createFrame(); f.name=name; f.resize(w,h); f.fills=color?fill(color):[];\n  f.clipsContent=false; return f;\n}\n// remove default page content\nconst compWrap=frame('Components · Library',3600,2600,null); page.appendChild(compWrap); compWrap.x=3400; compWrap.y=0;\n\n// ---- NavLink variants ----\nconst navStates=['Default','Hover','Current'];\nconst navComps={};\nfor(const st of navStates){\n  const c=figma.createComponent(); c.name='State='+st; c.resize(60,34);\n  c.layoutMode='VERTICAL'; c.primaryAxisSizingMode='AUTO'; c.counterAxisSizingMode='AUTO';\n  c.counterAxisAlignItems='MIN'; c.itemSpacing=5; c.fills=[]; c.clipsContent=false;\n  c.paddingBottom=3;\n  const label=st==='Current'?'Work':'Work';\n  const t=T(label,15,st==='Current'?F.M:F.R,st==='Hover'?ACC:INK,{lh:20});\n  c.appendChild(t);\n  const ul=figma.createRectangle(); ul.name='underline'; ul.resize(10,1.5);\n  ul.fills=fill(st==='Current'?ACC:(st==='Hover'?ACC:INK),st==='Current'?1:0);\n  c.appendChild(ul);\n  ul.layoutAlign='STRETCH';\n  navComps[st]=c; compWrap.appendChild(c); c.x=20; c.y=20+navStates.indexOf(st)*60;\n}\nconst navSet=figma.combineAsVariants([navComps.Default,navComps.Hover,navComps.Current],compWrap);\nnavSet.name='Nav Link'; navSet.x=20; navSet.y=20;\n\n// ---- FooterLink variants ----\nconst footComps={};\n['Default','Hover'].forEach((st,i)=>{\n  const c=figma.createComponent(); c.name='State='+st; c.resize(80,28);\n  c.layoutMode='VERTICAL'; c.primaryAxisSizingMode='AUTO'; c.counterAxisSizingMode='AUTO'; c.fills=[]; c.itemSpacing=4; c.paddingBottom=2;\n  const t=T('Artstation',14,F.R,st==='Hover'?ACC:INK,{lh:20});\n  c.appendChild(t);\n  const ul=figma.createRectangle(); ul.resize(10,1); ul.fills=fill(st==='Hover'?ACC:INK,st==='Hover'?1:0); c.appendChild(ul); ul.layoutAlign='STRETCH';\n  footComps[st]=c; compWrap.appendChild(c); c.x=320; c.y=20+i*60;\n});\nconst footSet=figma.combineAsVariants([footComps.Default,footComps.Hover],compWrap);\nfootSet.name='Footer Link'; footSet.x=320; footSet.y=20;\n\n// ---- TextLink: Type x State ----\nconst iconRight=await figma.getNodeByIdAsync('2:3');\nconst iconUpRight=await figma.getNodeByIdAsync('2:4');\nconst linkComps={};\nlet li=0;\nfor(const type of ['Internal','External']){\n  for(const st of ['Default','Hover']){\n    const c=figma.createComponent(); c.name='Type='+type+', State='+st; c.resize(200,26);\n    c.layoutMode='HORIZONTAL'; c.primaryAxisSizingMode='AUTO'; c.counterAxisSizingMode='AUTO';\n    c.counterAxisAlignItems='CENTER'; c.itemSpacing=8; c.fills=[]; c.paddingBottom=2;\n    const col=(st==='Hover'||type==='External')?ACC:INK;\n    const t=T(type==='Internal'?'See case study':'More shots from this project',15,F.M,col,{lh:22});\n    c.appendChild(t);\n    const ic=(type==='Internal'?iconRight:iconUpRight).createInstance();\n    ic.resize(14,14); c.appendChild(ic);\n    ic.findOne(n=>n.type==='VECTOR').strokes=fill(col);\n    linkComps[type+st]=c; compWrap.appendChild(c);\n    c.x=640+ (type==='External'?240:0); c.y=20+li*60; li++;\n  }\n}\nconst linkSet=figma.combineAsVariants([linkComps.InternalDefault,linkComps.InternalHover,linkComps.ExternalDefault,linkComps.ExternalHover],compWrap);\nlinkSet.name='Text Link'; linkSet.x=640; linkSet.y=20;\n\nreturn JSON.stringify({navSet:navSet.id,footSet:footSet.id,linkSet:linkSet.id, comps:Object.fromEntries(Object.entries(navComps).map(([k,v])=>[k,v.id]))});\n"},"caller":{"type":"direct"}}],"stop_reason":null,"stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"output_tokens":0,"service_tier":"standard","cache_creation_input_tokens":21088,"input_tokens":1,"cache_read_input_tokens":0,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":0,"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":21088}},"context_management":null},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"cb593a8f-1da1-4bf5-a6dd-8363759ec975","uuid":"383d4320-e8ca-49e3-ad12-28be37f97cb1","timestamp":"2026-11-01T23:40:04.488Z","tool_use_meta":[{"id":"toolu_01cmfT8gevvGdxLa6AxvCSIG","display_name":"Use Figma","server_display_name":"figma-authenticated-proxy","tool_name":"use_figma"}]}
